cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Who Moves First? Information Diffusion between Nasdaq-100 and S&P 500 Markets"
abstract: >-
  Measures how fast new information spreads between E-mini Nasdaq-100 and S&P 500
  futures (NQ, ES) and the ETFs that track the same indices (QQQ, SPY), using ten
  years of 1-minute data (2016-2026), 1-second data (July-October 2026) and 453
  macro announcements, with validated lead-lag measures, an event study and a
  trading-cost analysis.
authors:
